  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1694504731_7422369_a5e4fc3e9da8216b72161b601744b998download (3).png",
  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135); text-align: left; white-space: normal;\">A digital business card is a modern, contactless alternative to traditional paper business cards. Leveraging cutting-edge NFC technology, digital business cards can instantly share a wealth of information such as your name, job title, contact details, social media profiles, and even multimedia elements like videos or presentations.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135); text-align: left; white-space: normal;\">All it takes is a simple tap of your card on an NFC-enabled smartphone&mdash;be it Android or iPhone&mdash;to instantly transfer your details. The beauty of a digital business card is its dynamic nature. With platforms like NFC Tagify, you have the flexibility to update your business information in real-time without the need to reprint physical cards.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135); text-align: left; white-space: normal;\">Whether you opt for metal NFC business cards, wood digital business cards, or PVC contactless business cards, you can easily manage and edit your digital profile through a user-friendly online platform.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135); text-align: left; white-space: normal;\">Digital business cards are perfect for networking, marketing solutions, and making lasting impressions. Their universal compatibility and contactless convenience make them a must-have in today's fast-paced, digital world.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135); white-space: normal; text-align: center;\">No Subscription required - One time payment - Free online business card account</p>",
